relating to forward-looking statements and other &#8220;Risk Factors&#8221; discussed in Coherent&#8217;s Annual Report on Form <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">10-K</FONT> for the fiscal year ended June&nbsp;30, 2025 and Coherent&#8217;s most
